        "id": 69353,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-30T11:25:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>She doesn't really seem to bend reality - she just sends the heroes on wild goose chases (\"Threat\" to the President) or \"accidentally\" misinforms them about the nature of an assignment (\"Cat\" Stuck in a Tree, \"Diplomatic\" Envoy). Meanwhile she knows all their ins-and-outs, their weaknesses etc so she can mess them up at exactly the wrong moment (Suspicious Malfunction). It's like she woke up one morning with the wrong set of memories - those of another version of herself who was (or who believes she was) left to die by the Freedom Five in favour of some other random people, and now wants revenge for it.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
